{"45300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wings of Prey: Special Edition", "steam_appid": 45300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Edition includes original Wings of Prey game and Wings of Luftwaffe add-on.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wings of Prey</strong> is based around large-scale aerial combat in World War II. Players can participate in some of the most famous battles piloting fighters, attack aircraft and bombers across a range of thrilling missions. There are six theatres of war to engage in: The Battle of Britain, Stalingrad, the Ardennes, Berlin, Sicily and Korsun' representing some of the main airborne battles from World War II in Europe. <strong>Wings of Prey</strong> also boasts a sophisticated damage effects engine as well as advanced environmental visuals enriching the game play. It also features hundreds of aircraft taking part in air battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic World War atmosphere: Cutting edge technologies with highly detailed visuals bring the epic battles to life;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in more than 50 missions from famous historical battles over Eastern and Western Europe;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historically accurate aircraft: Experience over 40 models including fighters, attack aircraft and bombers. Learn to master a Spitfire, the Mustang, Messerschmitts and many more;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible difficulty level system: from arcade to realistic simulation;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support of 6-DOF TrackIR, TripleHead2Go, Saitek and Thrustmaster joysticks, mouse and voice headsets;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic sound effects and an original musical score from Jeremy Soule. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note! Multiplayer for Wings of Prey is no longer supported!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Edition includes original Wings of Prey game and Wings of Luftwaffe add-on.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wings of Prey</strong> is based around large-scale aerial combat in World War II. Players can participate in some of the most famous battles piloting fighters, attack aircraft and bombers across a range of thrilling missions. There are six theatres of war to engage in: The Battle of Britain, Stalingrad, the Ardennes, Berlin, Sicily and Korsun' representing some of the main airborne battles from World War II in Europe. <strong>Wings of Prey</strong> also boasts a sophisticated damage effects engine as well as advanced environmental visuals enriching the game play. It also features hundreds of aircraft taking part in air battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic World War atmosphere: Cutting edge technologies with highly detailed visuals bring the epic battles to life;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in more than 50 missions from famous historical battles over Eastern and Western Europe;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historically accurate aircraft: Experience over 40 models including fighters, attack aircraft and bombers. Learn to master a Spitfire, the Mustang, Messerschmitts and many more;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible difficulty level system: from arcade to realistic simulation;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support of 6-DOF TrackIR, TripleHead2Go, Saitek and Thrustmaster joysticks, mouse and voice headsets;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic sound effects and an original musical score from Jeremy Soule. </p></li></ul><p clas